                            <i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise me-2"></i>Ta bort status
                        </a></li>
                        <li class="entered-by-display" style="display:none;"><hr class="dropdown-divider"></li>
                        <li class="entered-by-display" style="display:none;">
                            <span class="dropdown-item-text small text-muted">Inmatat av <span class="entered-by-name"></span></span>
